  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.89ea43c": "proxy list usage instructions",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.5a6c01a": "1. Get content",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.96b0718": "Fill in the subscription URL and click Get from URL; if direct connection is not possible, choose an existing proxy to pull.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.c722a6e": "2. Check YAML",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.046f597": "There must be a proxies list in the text, and each node contains at least name, type, server, and port.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.ebb0287": "3. Parse and write",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.b138f91": "After parsing, first check the number and name of the nodes, and then confirm the import into proxy list.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.a531714": "Support content",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.ClashGuide.a85eb05": "The complete Clash subscription address can be retrieved directly or with the help of a proxy.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.ClashGuide.88593b0": "Full Clash YAML, or a YAML fragment containing only proxies",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.ClashGuide.79ec41e": "Common node types are parsed according to the current connector stack; xray stacks and mihomo stacks are not automatically mixed.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.65b10b6": "Pre-import checks",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.ClashGuide.2269da3": "When the subscription pull fails, change to \"pull proxy\" first, and do not paste the subscription URL as YAML.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.ClashGuide.986cb97": "Duplicate node names will affect subsequent identification. Distinguish the subscription source or node name before importing.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.ClashGuide.abc6d43": "When parsing is empty, directly check YAML indentation, proxies spelling, and whether port is a number.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.009d0a0": "1. Single import",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.016589a": "Use the form to fill in the protocol, address, port, account password; leave the text blank for assistance.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.865c558": "2. Batch import",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.d362f8f": "Fill in JSON, JSON array or multi-line proxy URL in the text assistant, and then click Apply Text or Parse.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.0cfc7c7": "3. Write proxy list",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.d230dcf": "After parsing, confirm the name, group and quantity, and then save it to proxy list",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.b8c63ae": "Field Rules",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.DirectGuide.ca6203b": "Only fill in the domain name or IP in the form address, without http://, https://, socks5://.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.DirectGuide.8172670": "The text URL must carry a protocol header, and the format is protocol://account:password@address:port.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.DirectGuide.0dfd85b": "Support http, https, socks5; if the password has a value, the account number must also be filled in.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.6470a2c": "Batch text",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.DirectGuide.b9d4bfe": "One proxy URL per line, empty lines will be ignored",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.DirectGuide.962d2be": "Lines starting with # or // are ignored and can be used for temporary comments",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.DirectGuide.dbf01d2": "Use JSON's group field when a group is required; plain URL lines without group",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.a7ae3d4": "IPFLY is implemented using chain proxy under the mainland network",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.b3762e6": "Fill in the local VPN / Mihomo exit on the first layer, and fill in the IPFLY gateway on the second layer. Traffic path: browser → xray → native VPN → IPFLY → target website.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.dadb13c": "1. Open local VPN",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.60be964": "Confirm that 127.0.0.1:7890 can travel overseas",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.dfc6fb9": "2. Import chain proxy",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.4c9234d": "The first layer is filled with the local outlet, and the second layer is filled with IPFLY.",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.6763209": "3. Debugging and detection timeout",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.ef9615e": "latency test target timeoutMs recommended 10000",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.title.90799df": "4. Bind browser",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.607e9c3": "After the IP health passes, it is assigned to the instance",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.f8282e3": "Field filling",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.95c5693": "First layer: socks5://127.0.0.1:7890",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.e18bce4": "Second layer: socks5://account:password@ep.ipflygates.com:6616",
  "browser.pages.proxyPool.ProxyPoolUsageGuideModal.text.fa9184b": "The account password is replaced with the value given by the IPFLY backend",
